      "comment": "KUNG FU ETHICS (3) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 520m behind Winsome Storm (30.33) in a Grade 5. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Has ability and can bounce back. POCKET TALK (1) turned in a fair run last time from the squeeze finishing fourth by 2 lengths (30.23). Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Expected to feature in the finish. DEEP SPACE (2) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing sixth (30.12) at Richmond in a Grade 5. Can feature with the right run. WOOLGOOLGA (7) scored last time and appeals as a top-three prospect.",
